# Hollins Cannery's cellar and Mrs. Elaine Hollins (CIPlay hollins_cannery_caves, 11-12 w10; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in its recipe: the sea cave's mouth at 66 22 on the shore under Smokehouse Hill (kit_st yaw 258, len 6,
# den floor ~2), the hatch at 46.4 17.8 in the den; Elaine sitting in the yard at -15 -9. The hatch is locked until
# someone talked to her; her three answers (the cellar, who heard it, no); the walk in and out; the cellar chest.
island Hollins Cannery keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden hccellarchest

# The sea cave from outside, the walk in to the den
picture hc_cave_out 75 7 27 66 3 22
walk 71 23 to 66 22 to 60 20.7 to 52 19 to 48 18.2 below=8
picture hc_cave_in 58 5.5 20.4 46.4 3 17.8 light=20

# The hatch: locked before anyone talked to Elaine
use hccellarhatch stay
expect message has the key
expect shown hccellarhatch
expect hidden hccellarchest

# Mrs. Elaine Hollins in the yard
picture hc_islander -11.5 4.8 -8 -15 4 -9
use Mrs. Elaine Hollins

# Now the hatch opens on the cellar chest
walk 60 20.7 to 52 19 to 48 18.2 below=8
use hccellarhatch stay
expect message louder than anywhere
expect hidden hccellarhatch
expect shown hccellarchest
open Hollins cellar
wait 2
expect item CopperIngot 2

# Her answers: 2 who heard it (journal), 3 no, 1 the cellar (journal)
use Mrs. Elaine Hollins pick 2
expect message Only Pim stayed
use Mrs. Elaine Hollins pick 3
expect message twelve past three
use Mrs. Elaine Hollins pick 1
expect message Go and listen

# Out of the cave again
walk 48 18.2 to 52 19 to 60 20.7 to 66 22 to 71 23 below=8
